menu "TouchDeck keys"

    config TD_LAZY_KEY_RECORD
        bool "Allocate the key record only when it first starts"
        default y
        help
            The 2048-report key record, 40960 bytes of PSRAM, is allocated by the first `keys record start` and kept
            until the next reboot, instead of at boot. Before that, `keys record dump` answers with a count of 0. Off,
            the record is allocated at boot.

endmenu
